[Medication Reminder App Mockup (Figma Community)](https://www.figma.com/community/file/1258995710276191086/medication-tracker-app-ui)

**How to Use:**
- Click the link.
- Press the “Duplicate” button in the top right to add it to your Figma workspace.
- Edit screens as needed for your pilot.

---

## 2. **No-Code Ready-to-Use Template (Glide)**

**Glide lets you build apps from Google Sheets easily. Here’s a free template for a medication tracker:**

[Medication Tracker Template (Glide)](https://www.glideapps.com/templates/medication-tracker)

**How to Use:**
- Click the link.
- Press “Copy this app.”
- Connect your Google account.
- Customize medication names, times, and add basic reminder features.

---

## 3. **MIT App Inventor Tutorial**

If you prefer a simple medication reminder using MIT App Inventor, here’s a step-by-step video tutorial:
