s. - Diverse roles among users suggest a mix of administrative and standard user access. ## Business or Operational Implications - Low login rates may signal issues with user onboarding, engagement, or value realization—reviewing the activation-to-engagement funnel is recommended. - Incomplete user profiles and lack of consent may pose compliance risks and hinder personalized communication; consider prompting users to complete their profiles and accept terms. - The presence of multiple roles and tenants supports flexible access control but requires careful management to avoid privilege misassignments. - Monitoring newly created accounts for activity can help identify and address potential drop-off points in the user journey. ","debugMode":false}', 'vanna_response'),
