('dddcd7b4-26b9-494f-85f9-51932f14629a', 'assistant', '**Generated SQL:**
```sql
SELECT 
    m.name AS model_name,
    SUM(e.tokens_output) * 1.0 / NULLIF(SUM(e.tokens_input), 0) AS token_efficiency
FROM [AIDD].usage_events e
JOIN [AIDD].llm_models m ON e.model_id = m.id
GROUP BY 
    m.name
ORDER BY
    token_efficiency DESC
```

