('5c8ab5ab-baec-43b4-90fe-596324da88a3', 'assistant', 'Absolutely! Here’s a detailed **Figma mockup specification** for your senior-focused medication reminder app, ready for easy handoff to a designer or for you to create yourself in Figma’s free tier.

---

## Medication Reminder App: Figma Mockup Specification

### 1. **Core Screens**
- **Home/Dashboard**
- **Add Medication**
- **Medication Reminder Notification**
- **History/Adherence Log**
- **Settings (Medfriend, Font size, etc.)**

---

### 2. **Design Guidelines**
- **Font sizes:** Headings 24–32pt; Body 18–22pt
- **Button size:** Minimum 44x44 px, preferably larger
- **Color contrast:** Use dark text on white or pale backgrounds, or white text on dark backgrounds; avoid color-only distinctions
- **Navigation:** Simple bottom bar or clear “Back” buttons
- **Icons:** Use universally recognized icons (pill, clock, checkmark, person)
- **Accessibility:** Large touch targets, optional font size adjustment in settings

---

### 3. **Screen-by-Screen Details**

#### **A. Home/Dashboard**
- Header: “Today’s Medications” (large, bold)
- List of medications:
    - Time (large, bold)
    - Medication name (large)
    - Dosage
    - Pill image/photo (optional)
    - [Taken] / [Mark as Taken] button (big, green, easy to tap)
- Add Medication button (bottom right, floating, large + icon)
- Navigation bar: Home | History | Settings

#### **B. Add Medication**
- Title: “Add Medication”
- Fields:
    - Medication name (text field, autofill suggestions)
    - Dosage (number field + dropdown for units)
    - Time(s) to take (time picker, large buttons)
    - Optional: Pill photo (camera icon)
- Save button (large, prominent)
- Cancel button (easy to find)

#### **C. Reminder Notification**
- Modal or notification screen:
    - “It’s time to take [Medication Name]”
    - Dosage info
    - Pill image (optional)
    - [Taken] button (green, large)
    - [Remind Me Later] button (secondary color, large)

#### **D. History/Adherence Log**
- Title: “My Medication History”
- List or calendar view:
    - Date/time
    - Medication name/dose
    - Status: Taken/Missed (color-coded, icons)
- Back button

#### **E. Settings**
- Title: “Settings”
- Font size adjustment (toggle or slider, preview text)
- Medfriend:
    - Add contact (name, phone/email)
- Notification preferences: sound, vibration
- Privacy/info

---

### 4. **Color Palette Example**
- Primary: #007AFF (blue), #4CAF50 (green)
- Background: #FFFFFF (white) or #F5F5F5 (light gray)
- Text: #222222 (dark gray), #FFFFFF (on dark backgrounds)
- Accent: #FF9800 (orange) for missed doses

---

### 5. **Accessibility**
- All touchable elements: at least 44x44 px
- All images/icons: descriptive alt text
- VoiceOver/TalkBack compatibility (label all fields and buttons)

---

### 6. **How to Create in Figma (Step-by-Step)**
1. **Sign up for a free Figma account:** [figma.com](https://www.figma.com/)
2. **Create a new project:** Name it “Senior Medication Reminder App”
3. **Add frames for each screen:** Use “Frame” tool, set to iPhone 8 or Pixel 2 size (375x667 px or similar)
4. **Layout each screen as described above:**  
    - Drag out large text fields, buttons, and icons  
    - Use Figma’s “Material Icons” or “Feather Icons” plugin for pill, clock, check, person
5. **Apply colors, fonts, and spacing:**  
    - Use “Roboto” or “SF Pro Text” for clarity  
    - Set background, button, and text colors per palette above
6. **Add navigation bar (bottom) to all screens**
7. **Link buttons to simulate navigation (“Prototype” mode)**
8. **Share with testers or export for developers**

---

### 7. **Quick Reference: Figma Layout Example**

**Home/Dashboard Screen**
```
-----------------------------------------
[Today’s Medications]        [Settings]
-----------------------------------------
| 9:00 AM  | Metformin 500mg | [Taken]
| 2:00 PM  | Lisinopril 10mg | [Mark as Taken]
| 8:00 PM  | Aspirin 81mg    | [Mark as Taken]
-----------------------------------------
         [+ Add Medication]
-----------------------------------------
[Home] [History] [Settings] (bottom bar)
```

**Add Medication Screen**
```
-----------------------------------------
[Add Medication]
-----------------------------------------
Medication Name: [___________]
Dosage:          [__] [mg/ml]
Time:            [09:00 AM] [Add time]
Pill Photo:      [Camera icon]
[Save]   [Cancel]
-----------------------------------------
```

---

## Ready-to-Use Figma Templates

**1. Free Medication App Figma UI Kits:**  
- [Free Medicine Reminder App Figma Template](https://www.figma.com/community/file/1161667018530140783)  
- [Figma Community Mobile UI Kits](https://www.figma.com/community/search?resource_type=files&sort_by=relevance&query=medication%20app)

**2. Step-by-Step Tutorials:**  
- [How to design an app in Figma (YouTube)](https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=figma+mobile+app+design+tutorial)
- [Figma Getting Started Guide](https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040514173-Getting-Started-with-Figma)

---

## What to Share with Your Designer/Team

- This specification document
- Any example UI kits from Figma Community
- Your brand colors (if any)
- Any feedback from your pilot users

---

**If you want, I can draft a Figma file outline and share a public link for you to duplicate and edit. Just let me know!**', NULL, 20, 0, 1342, '79e5b2bd-6ce3-4cb8-9b44-9f72c4c0a3be', '33bea8ee-5e12-438d-bf76-5d21a3a5a7c4', NULL, '8cc133c9-d905-468e-9231-6eac185f0e02', '2025-10-14 16:19:04.616000+00:00', '2025-10-14 16:19:04.616000+00:00', FALSE, NULL, NULL),
