lack of organizational structure. ## Insights - The user base is actively growing, but profile completeness and engagement (logins, consent) are low. - Administrative coverage is minimal, which may pose risks for oversight and management. - Email verification rates should be improved for better security and communication. - Lack of company or plan association could hinder future segmentation or feature access. ## Business or Operational Implications - Consider implementing onboarding improvements to encourage profile completion and consent collection. - Increase efforts to verify user emails to ensure secure and reliable contact. - Review and potentially expand administrative coverage to support user management and system oversight. - Assess the need for company and plan assignment to enable more granular access control and reporting. - Monitor user engagement and take steps to encourage active usage, such as reminders or incentives for logging in and updating profiles. "}', 'vanna_response'),
