t, with little evidence of organizational grouping. ## Business or Operational Implications - Efforts may be needed to encourage profile completion and regular logins to boost platform engagement. - Consider implementing mandatory email verification and consent processes to ensure compliance. - Review role assignments and privileges to align with security and operational needs. - Evaluate onboarding processes to improve data quality and user profile completeness. - Multi-tenancy and individual account management should be monitored for scalability and support requirements. ","debugMode":false}', 'vanna_response'),
