ations - Consider prompting users to complete their profiles and verify their emails to improve engagement and security. - Review onboarding processes to ensure users understand the need for consent and profile completion. - Monitor user activity to identify barriers to login or usage, and address them to increase platform adoption. - Assess whether company and plan associations are needed for future feature development or reporting. "}', 'vanna_response'),
