('e12c4311-09c1-421b-bd2c-9fc50d3d6050', 'assistant', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t have access to personal data or past interactions, including tenant IDs or conversation history. Each conversation with me is independent, and I don’t store or retain data about our interactions. If you have specific details you''d like help with, feel free to share, and I''ll assist to the best of my ability!', NULL, 2, 0, 66, '366c8e29-d8cd-4414-bbbc-aa5e6aed75db', '43ad5610-5fc9-419c-9255-3ff664829701', NULL, 'e0cb9a8c-0065-4140-a4bc-5d820957af38', '2025-10-27 13:02:48.249000+00:00', '2025-10-27 13:02:48.249000+00:00', FALSE, NULL, NULL),
