('343851d3-d3ba-4c20-b982-b0c470d2746b', 'user', 'help me create an app similar to medisafe app. The Medisafe app is a digital medication manager for Android and Apple devices that provides personalized reminders, helps avoid missed or double doses, and offers features like drug-to-drug interaction warnings, refill reminders, and report sharing. Users can manually log medications, add custom instructions, sync with apps like Apple''s HealthKit, and share their medication history with family or "Medfriends".  
Key Features
* Personalized Reminders: Set custom schedules and times for taking medications. 
* Medication Logging: Manually add new medications or import existing prescriptions. 
* Adherence Tracking: Log doses taken to maintain an accurate record of your medication history. 
* Drug Interaction Warnings: Get alerts about potential interactions between different medications. 
* Refill Reminders: Receive notifications when it''s time to reorder your medications. 
* Report Sharing: Generate and share reports of your medication adherence. 
* Medfriend Feature: Add trusted family members or friends to receive alerts if a dose is missed. 
* Health App Integration: Sync with Apple''s HealthKit to share medication data. 
* Resource Centers: Access in-depth information on various health conditions directly within the app. 
How It Works
1. Download the App: Get the Medisafe app from the Apple App Store or Google Play Store. 
2. Add Your Medications: Input your medication details, including name, dosage, and frequency. 
3. Set Up Reminders: Configure your preferred times for taking each medication. 
4. Get Alerts: The app will send you reminders to take your meds. 
5. Log Your Doses: Confirm when you take a dose to keep your log up-to-date.', NULL, 5, NULL, NULL, '79e5b2bd-6ce3-4cb8-9b44-9f72c4c0a3be', '33bea8ee-5e12-438d-bf76-5d21a3a5a7c4', 'ffc3bf4c-9a2d-473d-8c1d-d5a92bca90ef', NULL, '2025-10-13 13:03:58.809000+00:00', '2025-10-13 13:03:58.809000+00:00', FALSE, NULL, NULL),
