ding to encourage profile completion and consent collection. - Increase engagement efforts, such as reminders or incentives, to prompt first login and usage. - Review email verification processes to ensure all users are properly validated. - Monitor admin activity and consider assigning additional administrative roles for better platform oversight. - Evaluate the necessity of collecting company and plan information if relevant to business goals. "}', 'vanna_response'),
