ss or Operational Implications - Consider enforcing mandatory profile fields and email verification for improved security and user experience. - Low login activity among active users may indicate onboarding issues or lack of engagement; targeted outreach or user education could help. - Review consent processes to ensure compliance with privacy regulations. - Multi-tenancy is functioning, but tenant-level user management and reporting may need enhancement. - Admin users are rare; ensure sufficient administrative coverage for each tenant to support operations. "}', 'vanna_response'),
