ld impact communication and security. - The system is set up for multi-tenancy, but current usage trends toward individual accounts. ## Business or Operational Implications - Consider prompting users to complete their profiles for improved personalization and trust. - Increase efforts to encourage or require email verification to enhance security and deliverability. - Monitor user engagement and login activity to identify inactive accounts or onboarding friction. - Evaluate the need for company and plan associations if targeting business customers. - Review consent collection processes to ensure compliance with privacy regulations. "}', 'vanna_response'),
